WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:04.713 --> 00:00:05.505
The sun

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:08.842
shines at Disney's Animal Kingdom
theme park

00:00:09.843 --> 00:00:13.096
and at the Kilimanjaro Safaris, the hippos

00:00:13.096 --> 00:00:15.682
prepare for breakfast

00:00:24.065 --> 00:00:27.277
Tequila
lives in a blowout of six hippos,

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:31.614
one of the largest in managed care.

00:00:32.115 --> 00:00:34.993
Every day when the hippos come out,
we like to do a little produce toss

00:00:34.993 --> 00:00:39.205
to reward them for coming out here today
in the summer spirit.

00:00:39.581 --> 00:00:42.125
We have watermelon.

00:00:42.125 --> 00:00:45.336
Also a good chance for us to see
how the hippos are doing with eating

00:00:45.336 --> 00:00:48.256
something that big and that solid.

00:00:48.548 --> 00:00:51.301
Our focus today is actually going to be
a little bit more on tequila

00:00:51.301 --> 00:00:54.763
because she's had a few tooth issues
and her mouth has looked a little sore.

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:58.600
So we want to see how she does
with the watermelon.

00:00:59.267 --> 00:01:01.269
Tequila is middle aged now.

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:03.313
She's about 28 years old.

00:01:03.313 --> 00:01:04.272
And that's also part of why

00:01:04.272 --> 00:01:06.399
we're keeping a close eye on our teeth,
because she is starting

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:08.610
to get a little bit older.

00:01:08.610 --> 00:01:10.445
She is a very sassy hippo.

00:01:11.571 --> 00:01:13.740
She's a
little bit shorter than the rest of them,

00:01:13.740 --> 00:01:17.744
but she certainly doesn't
let that affect her attitude at all.

00:01:18.286 --> 00:01:20.497
All right, Tequila, are you ready?

00:01:20.497 --> 00:01:23.416
Go for it.

00:01:26.377 --> 00:01:26.961
Hey, go.

00:01:26.961 --> 00:01:33.885
Come get it, girl.

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:35.970
Did she get it? Yeah, she got it.

00:01:36.012 --> 00:01:38.765
It was a half one,
so she grabbed it real easy.

00:01:38.765 --> 00:01:39.265
Tequila.

00:01:39.265 --> 00:01:47.816
You want a whole one?

00:01:48.858 --> 00:01:50.318
Come on, Tequila.

00:01:50.568 --> 00:01:51.861
That was tequila right there.

00:01:51.861 --> 00:01:54.280
That's trying to grab that whole one.

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:57.450
Seems like she can't just chop
a whole watermelon like she normally does.

00:01:57.826 --> 00:01:59.202
Yeah, I agree.

00:01:59.285 --> 00:02:02.288
She's clearly not opening her jaw
all the way.

00:02:02.288 --> 00:02:04.874
Everybody else seems like
they're eating the watermelon pretty well,

00:02:05.500 --> 00:02:08.711
but she's just eating little scraps.

00:02:08.711 --> 00:02:09.712
This doesn’t look right

00:02:09.712 --> 00:02:12.340
I think we need to get a look at her
teeth.

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.592
Yeah.
Not chewing the way she normally does.

00:02:14.592 --> 00:02:16.302
Yeah, I think her tooth is bothering her.

00:02:16.302 --> 00:02:19.139
We'll definitely get a look
at her when she comes in.

